{"unit_id":"matata2017__dsh-codex-hooks#card-zh","repo":"matata2017/dsh-codex-hooks","commit":"c890a41b32fb1d6871b43a50234fe51d503e74ba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-hooks 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的生命周期钩子管理插件。它接入 agent、工具调用、审批和会话结束等事件，从用户配置、插件包及项目目录发现 hooks.json，并只运行获准且启用的命令钩子。主要功能包括按指纹审阅和信任钩子、匹配工具名称、在模型上下文中附加钩子结果、通过设置页或 /hooks 管理，以及查看每回合运行统计。适合希望在 DSH 工作流中配置自动化检查、上下文补充或审批处理的用户；需要 Node.js 20+ 和 DSH，配置可放在 ~/.dsh/hooks.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:504-539","lib/index.js:633-657","lib/core.js:644-724","client.js:1486-1589"]}
{"unit_id":"matata2017__dsh-codex-hooks#card-en","repo":"matata2017/dsh-codex-hooks","commit":"c890a41b32fb1d6871b43a50234fe51d503e74ba","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-codex-hooks adds lifecycle command hooks to DSH. It finds hooks.json in user, plugin, and project folders, then runs approved hooks on agent, tool, approval, and session events. Manage hooks in Settings or /hooks, match tools, add context, and view per-turn statistics. Requires Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:504-539","lib/index.js:633-657","lib/core.js:644-724","client.js:1486-1589"]}
{"unit_id":"matata2017__dsh-codex-hooks#feature-1","repo":"matata2017/dsh-codex-hooks","commit":"c890a41b32fb1d6871b43a50234fe51d503e74ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-hooks 的功能「多来源发现」：按当前用户配置、已安装插件包和已记住的项目目录查找 hooks.json，并在管理界面按来源分组。项目目录随会话工作区记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.js:644-724","lib/index.js:108-124"]}
